# arroxy
===
 Free open-source YouTube and +2000 sites downloader GUI based on yt-dlp for Windows, macOS, and Linux. Download videos, Shorts, 4K, 1080p60, HDR, playlists, channels, and subtitles with no ads, tracking, cookies, or login. Supports 30 languages.
